        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Gemini-4-Argon-cover.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/09/30/gemini-4-argon-announcement/\">the announcement</a> at the end of September, Gemini 4 Argon is starting to roll out to the Gemini app, Google Antigravity, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1073989\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/13/gemini-app-4-argon/#more-1073989\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
