        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/13/apple-announces-homepod-mini-2-siri-ai-new-colors-sound-glow-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/homepod.-mini-2.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has officially announced the new HomePod mini 2 smart speaker. The new product was announced by Apple today alongside the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/13/apple-homeview-announced-features-price-release-date/\">new HomeView smart display</a> and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/13/apple-announces-new-apple-tv-4k/\">fourth-gen Apple TV 4K</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"homepod,homepod-mini,homepod-mini-2,siri-ai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1073861\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/13/apple-announces-homepod-mini-2-siri-ai-new-colors-sound-glow-more/#more-1073861\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
