        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/beats-pokemon.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It looks like Apple’s Beats and Pokémon are teaming up for a Beats Pill Bluetooth speaker collaboration. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"beats,pokemon\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1073708\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/12/apple-confirms-beats-x-pokemon-collaboration-with-pill-speaker-teaser/#more-1073708\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
