        "title": "Zero to Agent in 30 Minutes: Build a Personal Assistant on OpenClaw",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/zero-to-agent-in-30-minutes-build-a-personal-assistant-on-openclaw/",
        "content_text": "In the final episode of Zero to Agent in 30 Minutes, AI engineer Sajal Sharma showed how to build a personal assistant on OpenClaw that tracks your tasks and notes and handles scheduled work on its own. A useful personal assistant has to be reachable when you’re away from your computer and keep running when [&#8230;]",
