        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Robert Englander’s blog site and is being reposted here with the author’s permission. The software industry has become deeply focused on autonomous AI systems. Agents that can replace workers. Agents that can write software. Agents that can operate applications on our behalf. Entire startups are now built around the [&#8230;]",
